└── README

-- File Ownership --
All files listed above are part of the Microchip P64H U-Boot project.
Any additional files not shown in this structure belong to the SysC RPMI repository.

-- Directory Roles --
include    : Contains the P64H board header file.
include/env: Provides libc adaptations for compatibility with U-Boot 
             header files.
librpmi    : Contains header and source files from the SysC RPMI library
             (see -- SysC RPMI Library Update --) 
librpmi-env: Implements the environment callback for the RPMI library.

-- SysC RPMI Library Update --
To update the SysC RPMI library, simply copy the required files from the SysC
repository into the librpmi directory. Do not copy the CMakefiles, but update
the 'Makefile' files.
